::  mar/clay/obelisk/obelisk-action: typed marc for poking %obelisk the
::  desk from grubbery fibers. It carries only the %tape variant the
::  bridge sends, TYPED: the desk's on-poke does a typed extract, and a
::  passthrough marc's untyped vase nest-fails it into a silent nack.
::  Deploys to /gub/mar/clay/obelisk/obelisk/action/hoon AND
::  /gub/mar/clay/obelisk/obelisk-action/hoon (both segment forms).
::
|_  a=[%tape db=@tas urql=tape]
++  grad  %noun
++  grow
  |%
  ++  noun  a
  --
++  grab
  |%
  ++  noun  ,[%tape db=@tas urql=tape]
  --
--
